error[algo/bound-dimension-mismatch]: `y` is read at dimension `nat` but bound at dimension `nat*`
  ┌─ ../../../../testdata/spec/neg/algo/dataflow-read-iterated-binding-in-pattern.watsup:8:13
  │
7 │   -- (if y = $(x + 1))*
  │          - bound here
8 │   -- if (z, y) = (0, 3)
  │             ^ `y` is read here
